      "g": 255,
      "b": 255,
      "a": 255
    },
    "_string": "1. The ranking of players in both Daily Ranking and Weekly Ranking is based on their daily and weekly total bel amounts.\n2. Rewards will be shown on the ranking activity page.\n3. The calculation of Daily Ranking starts at 00:00 local time, and finishes at 24:00 local time on the same day. And the daily rewards will be 1. distributed within half an hour after the daily cycle.\n4. The calculation of Weekly Ranking starts at 00:00 Monday local time, and finishes at 24:00 Sunday local time in the same week. And the weekly rewards will be distributed within half an hour after the weekly cycle.\n5.Monthly rankings are calculated from 00:00 local time on the first\nday of the month until 24:00 local time on the last day of the month.\nMonthly rewards will be issued within half an hour after the end of the monthly cycle.\n6.All players must bind their mobile phone number to participate in receiving rewards.",
